ies in the Triangle. Confused Meeno becomes suicidal.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gbWYt5MjGOxK2Sgf742zJdQE0yD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLVRyaWFuZ2xlLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMDUlMjktNzIwcC8.1.3","title":"Part 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2005-12-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"U.S. Secretary of the Navy has found a way to stop the Triangle phenomena. With their job done, the team goes home only to realize that a possible miscalculation in his plan could bring about the end of the world. Can the team stop it?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6nZFb8UFb0WaCJy3yt0FIdM069a.jpg"}]}}